Source: rustmail
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Rustmail <rustmail@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://rustmail.org

Package: rustmail
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, libfontconfig1, libwayland-client0, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, hicolor-icon-theme, xdg-utils
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, gnome-keyring
Description: Native Slint mail client
 Rustmail is a native desktop mail client built with Rust and Slint.
